磨着她。“啊~”大喊一声，战轻狂浑身散发着金光，照得人睁不开眼睛，意海中逐渐形成一本书，晶亮亮的，还泛着白光，总算是熬过去了，全身无力的战轻狂发出一声叹息，挺过来了，可是一点力气都没有了，仰躺在树下，她等着身体自动恢复。不知过了多久，她总算是有力气了，小手指动了一下，渐渐的整个胳膊恢复了知觉，用手支撑着身体，好不容易爬到泉边，直到喝下几口泉水，总算是缓了过来。刚刚是怎么回事？怎么好好的会那样头痛，对了，是血！意海中有什么形成了？战轻狂闭上眼睛，凝神聚气，一点点的放松心灵，看见意海中多了一本书，一本巨大的，闪着金白色光芒的书，书上写着不知道是什么体的大字，可是她却能看明白，是“随心宝典”。随心？是想什么就有什么的意思吗？试试看，她现在最大的心愿就是能够修炼灵力，将想法化成意念，果然，宝典自动翻页了，看上去很是沉重的书页被无声的翻开，奇怪的是，明明看不出是什么字体，她能看明白上面写的是什么，第一页上面写着——灵之乍现。果然是修习灵力的方法，只见最上边一段写着：所谓灵力，是指人之初生时，第一次吸收的天地之气，天地万物都有灵，无论是一棵树，一片叶，还是一朵花，或者是所有的生灵。而其中最能够感受灵气所在的就是人类，当出生的婴儿凭借自己的天赋去吸收这灵气时，就能为他所用，化为身体中的灵力。可也不是每个人都有这样的天赋。除却人类之外，动物和植物也可以凝聚灵力，只是他们神智未开，修习的速度比不上人类。哦哦，原来灵力是这么来的，可是南宫轻狂的身体好像没有这种天赋啊！那她怎么办？突然她发现，她能看见空间里一闪一闪的金光了，正逐渐汇聚在自己的身体里，冲击着每一寸血肉，每一根筋骨，不是吧！还来？当身体又有痛感袭来时，战轻狂真的想骂人，虽说吃得苦中苦，方为人上人，可是这“苦”的频率也太高了吧！咬咬牙挺住，战轻狂接着往下看，当婴儿逐渐长大时，初生吸收的灵气将汇聚于灵基所在，散布到全身血脉，生生不息，永无止境，直到人亡，或者灵基被损坏。而灵力随着不断的修习，会渐渐提升等级，在灵基中形成不同类型的灵珠，每次晋级会有天地法则形成。而以灵力强度划分强者的级别。分别是：灵者：初级灵者，中级灵者，高级灵者。（法阵无色）灵师：初级灵师，中级灵师，高级灵师。（法阵灰色）大灵师，由低到高，分成五级。（法阵为粉色）灵王，由低到高，分成五级。（法阵为红色）灵帝，由低到高，分成五级。（法阵为橙色）灵圣，由低到高，分成五级。（法阵为黄色）每个级别在使用灵力的时候，脚下会有法阵，不等的灵星显示，接下来是强者的划分：黄乾境（分成九级，法阵为绿色）玄冥境（分成九级，法阵为青色）地坤境（分成九级，法阵为蓝色）天璇境（分成九级，法阵为紫色）往上还有其他级别的强者，暂不显示。看到这儿，战轻狂郁闷了，说话说一半，上不来下不去的。不过，看样子，应该还有更强的强者存在吧！只是她的等级没到那个程度，多说无益吧！打起精神，接着看，根据灵力属性不同，系别不同，分别是：金系、木系、水系、火系、土系、光系、暗系、风系、雷系、冰系。无论人还是兽，都有灵力属性的划分，植物多为木系。灵隐大陆上的职业分别是：修灵者，炼药师，御兽师，炼器师，修武者，佣兵，商人，普通人。其中修灵者最常见，人数最多；炼药师，御兽师，炼器师人数较少，更为尊贵；修武者身体比其他职业更为强壮；佣兵以团队合作，出任务过活；商人维持贸易；普通人是最为低等的存在。看了许久，战轻狂总算对这大陆有了些许了解，就在她分神的时候，无数的星光点点全部分散在她的身体里，疼痛早已过去。睁开眼，她发现身体里的金色的星光和生命空间里的一模一样，难道是生命元素？真让她猜对了，这具身体里没有灵力的形成，所以导致她无法修习，而生命元素代替了灵力的形成，给她提供了巨大的帮助，而她不知道的是，生命元素不仅能提高她修习的速度，还会有意想不到的收获。战轻狂顾不上诧异，赶紧按照宝典上所写的，将这些元素都汇聚到灵基，逐渐形成一团，获得成功的她喜上眉梢。刚想加紧脚步，再看看宝典上还写了什么，却发现宝典翻不开第二页了，聪明的她一下子就想明白了，她现在还没有“资格”往下看，相信等到她站在一定高度时，宝典会为她敞开的，今天的收获她已经很满意了。“咕咕”肚子传来叫声，战轻狂决定还是祭拜一下她的五脏庙吧！闪身出了生命空间，她向着林子深处走去，记得这里应该有野鸡，兔子什么的。打了一只野山鸡，战轻狂的野外生存技能让人叹服，宰杀，拔毛，清除五脏，做的井井有条，除了味道淡点，她吃的还算满意。洗洗手，将火熄了，她又回到生命空间中修习了，要说这生命空间还真是好啊！温暖又安全，除了太阳不落山，没有夜晚之外，还真是个适合居家过日子的好场所，不用担心有人或者野兽偷袭，不用担心天气原因，浓郁的生命元素适合修习，渴了有水喝，饿了还有果子充饥，人生也不过如此了！然而第二天，现实打了她一个措手不及。当她遇到一头野猪，想拿灵力练练手时，发生了让她瞠目结舌的一幕，她身体里的灵力丝毫都没有了，就和一个普通人一样，狼狈的躲过野猪的攻击，没等她想明白是怎么回事，又闪身躲过野猪的一次攻击，丫的，没看见她想事呢吗？没眼力劲儿的野猪，不把你打的皮开肉绽，你就不知道花儿为什么这样红！憋了一口气，运用古武技巧将野猪打的嗷嗷乱叫，扭头就跑，心中才出了一口气。可是出完气之后，她又纠结了，这到底是怎么回事？心情沉重的战轻狂，又回到了生命空间，开始重新修习，盘膝冥想，感受着生命元素疯狂的涌进身体，逐渐形成一个流动的圆球形，她才放松下来，看来她还是能修习灵力的，只是不知道是什么原因造成灵力消失，放下心来的她决定还是去城里买些调料，毕竟只是烤肉不是那么好吃。花了一天的时间准备好一切，战轻狂觉得生活还是很美好的！可是第三天，她想抓狂，修习了一天的灵力又不见了，不信邪的她开始和这消失的灵力较上劲儿了，每天除了必须的吃喝拉撒，她都在不停的修习，甚至不断加强力度，哪怕将经脉撑得生疼也不放弃。然而奇怪的是，不管她多么努力，在灵基中积累多少灵力，次日都会消失的一点都不剩。难道这身体还有什么问题吗？有了代替灵力的生命元素还是不行吗？一个多月不停的抗争，战轻狂有些灰心，是她异想天开了吗？刚想将烤的焦黄的鱼放在嘴里，突然胃酸上涌，哇的吐了出来，吐得她眼泪鼻涕一起流，身体出问题了吗？她不由得有些纳闷，还是去找个大夫看看吧，灵力修不修习还是小事，身体是革命的本钱，本钱可不能丢。因此，她只能将烤的香喷喷的鱼扔掉，披好斗篷，目的地：芸城。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/hundanmohouxiaozhangniangqing/6.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 6 After practicing spiritual power and burying Nangong Qingkuang, Zhan Qingkuang had to make plans for his future path. She believes that nothing is absolute. She can't cultivate spiritual power. What a waste? That would never be her fighting against Qing Kuang! During this time, she became accustomed to the way of survival of those spiritual cultivators, which strengthened her determination to take the path of the strong. Only the strong are respected by everyone and are the people who stand at the top in this world. With a flash, she entered the life space. She remembered the efficacy of the spring water and fruits in the space, and couldn't wait to try them. However, no matter how much she meditated and practiced, she still couldn't gather a trace of spiritual power in her body. Damn it, Zhan Qingkuang scratched his head irritably. People here are awakened to spiritual power from birth, and the elders in the clan use spiritual stones to hold awakening ceremonies for their children. However, Nangong Qingkuang has been denied it since she was born, and no one has taught her this over the years. Therefore, Zhan Qingkuang is a little lost at this time. Is it possible to just follow the crowd and let others bully her? No, no, that’s not her fighting against frivolity! Damn it, what to do, how to do it? He pounded the ground again and again, and soon his hands were covered with cuts and bleeding. At this moment, a magical scene happened. The blood on the ground suddenly disappeared, as if it had been swallowed by something, and there was severe pain in her head. Her whole head seemed to explode, swollen and painful, her face was burned red, and the veins on her forehead burst. Unable to bear it, Zhan Qingkuang suddenly fainted and lost consciousness, but the pain became more obvious, tormenting her relentlessly. \"Ah~\" shouted, Zhan Qingkuang's whole body was emitting golden light, which made people unable to open their eyes. A book gradually formed in his mind, which was bright and glowing with white light. Finally, he got through it. Zhan Qingkuang, who was weak all over, sighed and survived, but he had no strength at all. She lay on her back under the tree, waiting for her body to recover automatically. After an unknown amount of time, she finally gained strength. She moved her little fingers, and gradually her whole arm regained consciousness. She supported her body with her hands and finally crawled to the spring. After drinking a few mouthfuls of spring water, she finally recovered. What happened just now? Why do I have such a headache? Yes, it’s blood! What is formed in the sea of ​​thoughts? Zhan Qingkuang closed her eyes, concentrated her energy, and relaxed her mind little by little. She saw a book in her mind, a huge book with golden and white light. There were large characters written in unknown characters, but she could understand that it was \"Xi Xin Bao Bao\". Follow your heart? Does it mean whatever you think about it? Try it. Her biggest wish now is to cultivate spiritual power and turn thoughts into ideas. Sure enough, the pages of the book turned automatically. The pages that looked very heavy were turned silently. The strange thing was that she could not see the font, but she could understand what was written on it. The first page said - The Appearance of Spirit. Sure enough, it is a way to practice spiritual power. The top paragraph reads: The so-called spiritual power refers to the energy of heaven and earth that is absorbed for the first time when a person is born. Everything in the world has spirit, whether it is a tree, a leaf, a flower, or all living things. Among them, the ones who can feel the spiritual energy the most are humans. When a baby is born to absorb this spiritual energy with its own talent, it can be used by him and turned into spiritual power in the body. But not everyone has such a talent. In addition to humans, animals and plants can also condense spiritual power, but their minds are not yet enlightened, and the speed of practice cannot be compared with humans. Oh, so that’s how spiritual power comes from, but Nangong Qingkuang’s body doesn’t seem to have this talent! What should she do? Suddenly she discovered that she could see flashes of golden light in the space, gradually converging in her body, impacting every inch of flesh and blood, every muscle and bone, right? Still coming? When pain hit his body again, Zhan Qingkuang really wanted to curse. Although he had to endure hardships to become a master, the frequency of such \"suffering\" was too high! Gritting his teeth and holding on, Zhan Qingkuang then looked down. When the baby grows up, the spiritual energy absorbed by the newborn will gather at the spiritual base and spread to the blood of the whole body, endlessly and endlessly, until the person dies or the spiritual base is damaged. With continuous practice, spiritual power will gradually increase its level, forming different types of spiritual beads in the spiritual base. Each time you advance, the laws of heaven and earth will be formed. The level of strong people is divided based on the strength of their spiritual power. They are: Spirit: primary spirit, intermediate spirit, advanced spirit. (Colorless magic circle) Spiritual Master: Junior Spiritual Master, Intermediate Spiritual Master, Senior Spiritual Master. (Array Gray) Great spiritual masters are divided into five levels from low to high. (The magic circle is pink) The Spirit King is divided into five levels from low to high. (The magic circle is red) The Spirit Emperor is divided into five levels from low to high. (The magic circle is orange) Spiritual Saints are divided into five levels from low to high. (The magic circle is yellow) When using spiritual power at each level, there will be a magic circle under the feet, and different spiritual stars are displayed. Next is the division of the strong: Huanggan Realm (divided into nine levels, the magic circle is green) Xuanming Realm (divided into nine levels, the magic circle is cyan) Dikun Realm (divided into nine levels, the magic circle is blue) Tianxuan Realm (divided into nine levels, the magic circle is purple) There are other levels of strong people above, which are not shown yet. Seeing this, Zhan Qingkuang became depressed. He couldn't get up or down while talking halfway. However, it seems that there should be stronger ones out there! It’s just that her level is not that high, so it’s useless to say more! Cheer up and continue reading. According to the different spiritual attributes, there are different types, namely: metal type, wood type, water type, fire type, earth type, light type, dark type, wind type, thunder type, and ice type. Whether humans or animals, there are divisions of spiritual attributes, and most plants are of the wood type. The professions on Lingyin Continent are: spiritual cultivators, pharmacists, beast masters, weapon refiners, martial arts cultivators, mercenaries, merchants, and ordinary people. Among them, spiritual practitioners are the most common and have the largest number of people.", "title_en": "Chapter 6"}